from the GossipCop dataset (Shu et al., 2020)(Dou758\
et al., 2021). The objective is to train a Graph759\
Neural Network (GNN) that predicts whether a760\
news article is real or fake by leveraging both node761\
features and the underlying propagation structure.762\
Given a collection of graphs G = \{Gk\}, where763\
each graph Gk = (Vk, Ek) represents the spread of764\
a single news article, the task is to predict the label765\
yk for each graph:766\
f (Gk) \uc0\u8594  yk767\
In this setting, nodes correspond to either the768\
